\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies of various forms but equal danger lurk within the remnants of the world, a reminder to always be cautious during your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/9f763adeab991daebcf8aff407a48623.poster.avif?t=1772027680\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/9f763adeab991daebcf8aff407a48623.webm?t=1772027680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/extras/9f763adeab991daebcf8aff407a48623.mp4?t=1772027680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory, self, and meaning. Under layers of intertwining narratives, the world and its characters together tell a tale of both sorrow and resolute.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Our journey begins with parting, and perhaps it will also face parting in the end. The hardships along the way will surpass your understanding and imagination... You might even feel pain because of this.&quot;</i><br><br><i>&quot;Even so, will you still come with me?&quot;</i></h2>","developers":["\u6708\u76f8\u4eeaLunarium"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939790/header.jpg?t=1772027680","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2939790/1200266227/c8602d43361bfdcce85fb69df91118b3bd9c8e9e/1751017600/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751020979","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.s