e lost glow of the stars and forsaken memories, unveiling cosmic secrets.","steam_appid":2939790,"support_info":{"email":"lunariumstudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}